  "solution": {
    "text": "Here, <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow></msup></math><br/><br/>Or       <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msup></math>]<br/><br/>Comparing powers of <math><mi>M</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>L</mi></math> and <math><mi>T</mi><mo>,</mo></math> we get<br/><br/><math><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br/><br/>Solving <math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>"
